message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article below. To identify the exact version of the code, also give the release tag (see the version table in README.md)."
type: software
title: "HCC Surveillance Markov Model"
version: "1.3.0"
abstract: >
  R code implementing a Markov model for hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC)
  surveillance in patients with cirrhosis after hepatitis C cure. Models
  BCLC-stage progression, ultrasound sensitivity, patient adherence, and
  treatment outcomes to estimate life-years gained under various surveillance
  strategies.
